From 44c02e7f4ad98c3e36b45aadf64133153eb35b8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicolas Le Bayon <nicolas.le.bayon@st.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Oct 2023 23:35:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 0617/1695] clk: stm32mp21: introduce STM32MP21 clock driver

Add clk-stm32mp21.c driver file and the list of RCC registers. Update
makefile to compile it when flag CFG_STM32MP21_CLK is set.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git aa6971c0f14e9c546ebbfb8028c6e4867bab013e clk: stm32mp21: introduce STM32MP21 clock driver]
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Signed-off-by: Nicolas Le Bayon <nicolas.le.bayon@st.com>
Change-Id: Ie1cd9fd34372d4f7370a1498a37e1b6694cb408c
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/360983
Reviewed-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
Domain-Review: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
Tested-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
